{"id":"H8559","lemma":"תָּמָר","transliteration":"tamar","sayIt":"ta-MAR","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Tamar","meaning":"A woman living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.38.6; married to Judah (H3063) and Er (H6147);\nmother of: Perez (H6557) and Zerah (H2226I)\nAlso named: Thamar (Θάμαρ \"Tamar\" G2283)\n§ Tamar = \"palm-tree\"\n1) widow of Er, the son of Judah; fiancee of Shelah, another son of Judah; wife of Judah and mother of Pharez and Zerah\n2) daughter of David by Maacah, sister of Absalom, and rape victim of Amnon her half brother, another son of David\n3) daughter of Absalom\n4) a place on the southern border of Gad","glosses":["tamar","so tamar","when tamar","has","run from tamar","waters"],"count":23,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"to Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"When Tamar","kjv":"Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"has","kjv":"Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"rut-4","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"whom Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"with Tamar","kjv":"was Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"let Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"to Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"So Tamar","kjv":"So Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"unto Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Tamar","kjv":"And Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"So Tamar","kjv":"So Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-13","v":32,"renderings":{"kjv":"Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-14","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"was Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Tamar","kjv":"And Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Tamar","kjv":"and Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"ezk-47","v":18,"renderings":{}},{"chapterId":"ezk-47","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"it will run from Tamar","kjv":"from Tamar"}},{"chapterId":"ezk-48","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"the waters","kjv":"shall be even from Tamar"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 38:6","note":"Judah took a wife for Er, his firstborn, and her name was Tamar.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ruth 4:12","note":"Let your house be like the house of Perez, whom Tamar bore to Judah, of the offspring which Yahweh will give you by this young woman.”","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 13:1","note":"After this, Absalom the son of David had a beautiful sister, whose name was Tamar; and Amnon the son of David loved her.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:4","note":"Tamar his daughter-in-law bore him Perez and Zerah. All the sons of Judah were five.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezekiel 47:18","note":"“The east side, between Hauran and Damascus and Gilead, and the land of Israel, shall be the Jordan; from the north border to the east sea you shall measure.…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0053","lemma":"אֲבִישָׁלוֹם","transliteration":"avishalom","gloss":"Absalom"},{"id":"H0467","lemma":"אֲלִיפֶ֫לֶט","transliteration":"eliphelet","gloss":"Eliphelet"},{"id":"H4601","lemma":"מַעֲכָה","transliteration":"maakhah","gloss":"Maacah"},{"id":"H8412","lemma":"תַּדְמֹר","transliteration":"tadmor","gloss":"Tadmor"},{"id":"H0476","lemma":"אֱלִישָׁמָע","transliteration":"elishama","gloss":"Elishama"},{"id":"H0138","lemma":"אֲדֹנִיָּ֫הוּ","transliteration":"adoniyyah","gloss":"Adonijah"},{"id":"H0222","lemma":"אוּרִיאֵל","transliteration":"uriel","gloss":"Uriel"},{"id":"H0450","lemma":"אֶלְיָדָע","transliteration":"elyada","gloss":"Eliada"}],"senses"